{
  "BK_9080_0360_NAR": "We have seen how Cereza and Cheshire's journey went from here,\r\nbut what of Jeanne? What happened to her after learning of her fate?",
  "BK_9040_0080_NAR": "So close! Whoever was behind this \r\nwas determined to keep the girls apart. \r\nCharles bared his fangs \r\nand began to growl.",
  "SM_009010_0260_JEA": "“Very well demon. Now...into the vessel you go!”",
  "LV_009045_0000_SIN": "My brave friend...Leave now, I implore you.",
  "BK_9020_0030_NAR": "For years, this young girl had protected Cereza,\r\nalways being sure to watch over her from afar.\r\n\r\nHer name was Jeanne, \r\nand she too was an Umbra Witch \r\njust beginning her training.",
  "BK_9060_0060_JEA": "“No...No...let go of him!”",
  "LV_009035_0000_JEA": "What is this place?\r\nThe faerie stench is overwhelming...",
  "SM_009020_0210_JEA": "“But come on, you must like \r\nthat body. Better than the lump \r\nof scraps Cereza drags around.”",
  "BK_9040_0130_SIN": "Yes...You may call me...\r\nhe who affirms all phenomena.”",
  "SM_009020_0170_NAR": "Charles blinked incredulously.\r\nHome...to Inferno?\r\nThis was something unexpected.\r\nDid Jeanne have such a power?",
  "CE_009805_0000_SIN": "Jeanne, leave now. It is not too late.",
  "BK_9080_0350_NAR": "Thus concludes the adventure of Jeanne and Charles.",
  "SM_009010_0130_NAR": "Jeanne knew Cereza well.\r\nSeeing the demon-possessed stuffed cat, \r\nshe instantly grasped the situation.",
  "BK_9070_0040_JEA": "“I will not fear my fate.\r\nWhatever may come,\r\nI will stand and face it.”",
  "LV_009020_0020_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Like it?! I'm counting down the seconds \r\ntill she gets me back to Inferno![FONT:N ]",
  "BK_9050_0110_SIN": "“Jeanne.\r\nI have shown you a vision of \r\nthings to come. If you do not \r\ndistance yourself from her,\r\nthat future will certainly find you.",
  "BK_9040_0000_JEA": "“Cereza...!? \r\nIt's faint, but I can sense her magic.\r\nAnd she's not alone...”",
  "BK_9050_0100_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Stop these stupid tricks! I'll rip you apart![FONT:N ]\r\nCharles tried with all his might,\r\nbut he could not move.",
  "BK_9050_0090_NAR": "It was a vision of Jeanne as \r\na grown woman... dealt a fatal \r\nblow by an unknown assailant.",
  "SM_009010_0010_JEA": "“Is that...Cereza's stuffed cat? \r\nShe must be in trouble, I knew it!”",
  "BK_9050_0130_NAR": "The spectre rose once again.\r\nSuspended mid-air, he looked down on \r\nthem with his piercing gaze.\r\nHe slowly turned to face Cereza.",
  "LV_009055_0030_NAR": "Whatever lay ahead would change her fate forever...",
  "SM_009010_0340_NAR": "Thus began Jeanne and Chesh-\r\nI mean, Jeanne and Charles's search for Cereza.",
  "BK_9060_0160_SIN": "“What...what is happening?\r\nArch-Eve Origin...\r\nCould she have awakened?!”",
  "SM_009010_0020_JEA": "“As I thought...this is no faerie magic!”",
  "BK_9050_0120_SIN": " \r\nBut this fate is not yet determined.\r\nLeave now and it may yet be avoided.”",
  "LV_009055_0040_NAR": "Jeanne could not shake this feeling.\r\nAn inexplicable fear began to swell inside her.",
  "SM_009010_0330_NAR": "Cheshire was not fond of his new name,\r\nbut now was not the time: \r\nany protest would have to wait.",
  "BK_9060_0080_SIN": "“After I'm finished with him, you're next.\r\nI tried to warn you not to get involved...\r\nIt's a pity you would not listen.”",
  "LV_009015_0020_JEA": "Crybaby? Oh, you mean Cereza.",
  "BK_9050_0150_SIN": "“Then, finally, phenomenal affirmation will be realised!”",
  "CE_009825_1000_SIN": "Incredible...you managed to cram a demon in there?",
  "SM_009020_0260_CER": "“Cheshire...there you are.\r\nI'm gone for a minute and \r\nyou get yourself lost again.”",
  "BK_9050_0160_SIN": "",
  "SM_009010_0300_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Charles?![FONT:N ] Perhaps the demon had \r\ngrown more attached to the name \r\n'Cheshire' than he cared to admit.",
  "BK_9060_0120_SIN": "“Impossible.\r\nArch-Eve Origin is under my spell.\r\nShe will not wake again, ever.”",
  "CE_009825_5000_SIN": "You pathetic demon...You think you can best me?!",
  "BK_9040_0070_JEA": "",
  "BK_9020_0070_NAR": "Jeanne had been warned about \r\nthe risks of Soul Projection, \r\nbut that stayed her hand nary a moment.",
  "SM_009020_0100_NAR": "The colour had begun \r\nto return to Cereza's cheeks.",
  "SM_009010_0140_NAR": "She thought for a moment,\r\nthen had a truly devilish idea.",
  "BK_9010_0000_NAR": "We have heard the tale of an unlikely friendship\r\nbetween a young witch and a lost demon.\r\nBut there is a secret chapter hidden \r\nin its pages that remains untold.",
  "CE_009825_2000_SIN": "What a pitiful attempt at a summon!",
  "SM_009010_0210_JEA": "“Fine by me. \r\nBest of luck then.”",
  "LV_009005_0000_JEA": "What...is that?",
  "BK_9040_0200_JEA": "“What absolute poppycock.\r\nI won't let you lay a finger \r\non my Umbran sister.”",
  "BK_9040_0170_SIN": "“A slight miscalculation, but she \r\nwill be mine soon nonetheless. \r\nAnd then, I will affirm my world!”",
  "SM_009020_0130_NAR": "Jeanne's body had grown faint.\r\nHer technique had reached its limit; her \r\ntravelling soul yearned to return to her body.",
  "BK_9020_0040_NAR": "Unlike Cereza, Jeanne lived in the Umbra \r\nWitch village. Though forbidden, she often \r\nsnuck out to meet her rival; the two never \r\nmissed a chance to compare strength.",
  "BK_9010_0050_CER": "",
  "BK_9040_0020_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Look! Over there![FONT:N ]\r\nCharles had spotted something.",
  "CE_009810_0000_SIN": "Very well...",
  "SM_009010_0030_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Who are you?[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire's voice alarmed Jeanne.",
  "CE_009800_2000_SIN": "Now I've got you!",
  "BK_9070_0060_NAR": "His power extinguished, \r\nthe spectre's body flickered, \r\nthen faded away.",
  "LV_009020_0000_JEA": "That said...\r\nWell, I'm not surprised she summoned \r\na demon into a stuffed cat.",
  "CE_009810_0020_NAR": "The spectre opened a scroll and \r\ncalled forth a faerie from thin air.",
  "LV_009050_0000_SIN": "Go any farther and you will regret it...",
  "BK_9040_0010_NAR": "Something put Jeanne's nerves on edge.\r\nThis presence belonged to no faerie.",
  "SM_009010_0190_NAR": "Compared to Cheshire's tattered felt,\r\nits velvet fur had a rich sheen. \r\nNevertheless...",
  "BK_9010_0060_CER": "“Where am I?\r\nCheshire?\r\nCheshire, where are you?”",
  "LV_009055_0010_JEA": "You're hiding Cereza, aren't you?\r\nWhere is she?!",
  "BK_9050_0080_JEA": "",
  "SM_009010_0000_NAR": "As Jeanne proceeded through the woods,\r\nshe noticed something peculiar.",
  "BK_9040_0180_NAR": "As he spoke, the spectre's eyes grew crazed.\r\nThey smouldered with a dark energy.",
  "BK_9060_0070_NAR": "Charles screamed out in agony.\r\nThe spectral flames were slowly eating \r\nthrough his body, tearing him apart.",
  "LV_009035_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Yeah, this place is always crawling with 'em.\r\nPerfect for a quick snack.[FONT:N ]",
  "BK_9020_0010_JEA": "“Oh no, I figured she could handle \r\nthat forest without my help.\r\n...But this power is unlike anything \r\nI've ever felt before.”",
  "SM_009020_0160_JEA": "“I'm asking, \r\nwill you go back to that tattered doll,\r\nor shall I send you home to Inferno?”",
  "BK_9080_0340_JEA": "“Whatever lies ahead...I'll be ready!\r\nI'm going to be the strongest witch of all!”",
  "SM_009010_0120_JEA": "“Wait...a demon, here...\r\nDid Cereza summon you?”",
  "SM_009010_0240_NAR": "And with good reason. \r\nIn a moment he would be \r\nsucked into that void for good.",
  "CE_009800_1000_SIN": "Now is the time for all to be affirmed!",
  "BK_9060_0050_SIN": "And when those pleas go unanswered...\r\nThat is when you witness true despair.”",
  "LV_009035_0020_NAR": "The demon had learned a few things \r\non his journey, so he took this \r\nopportunity to show off.",
  "SM_009020_0230_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Besides, you're too rough for my taste.\r\nAt least the pipsqueak gives me a break \r\nonce in a while.[FONT:N ]",
  "BK_9020_0020_JEA": "“It goes against all Umbran teachings,\r\nbut I have no choice.”",
  "CE_009835_0000_JEA": "Stop playing with her memories, you monster!",
  "SM_009010_0200_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Like I'd trust a human - you're all the same!\r\nYou won't trick me![FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire barked at Jeanne.",
  "BK_9050_0070_NAR": "A moment later, a torrent of horrible visions \r\nbegan to flood into Jeanne's mind.",
  "SM_009020_0120_JEA": "“I think she'll be all right.\r\nThey will be able to return to the forest,\r\nand...it looks like my time is almost up.”",
  "BK_9020_0050_JEA": "“I swear, that girl likes to keep me busy.”",
  "SM_009020_0270_NAR": "With a peaceful expression on her face,\r\nshe gave Cheshire a big squeeze.",
  "BK_9050_0050_SIN": "“I will show you, Jeanne;\r\ngive you a glimpse at what will happen\r\nif you continue along your current path.”",
  "BK_9070_0090_JEA": "Cereza?!”",
  "SM_009010_0150_JEA": "“I have a proposition for you demon:\r\nI'll get you unstuck, but in return\r\nyou help me find Cereza.”",
  "BK_9060_0010_SIN": "“...Perhaps I was not clear?\r\nI will achieve Phenomenal Affirmation!\r\nThe two of you altering that is a statistical impossibility.”",
  "SM_009010_0230_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]W-wait![FONT:N ] Cheshire yelled, \r\nunable to conceal his distress.",
  "BK_9040_0140_JEA": "“My, that's quite a mouthful.\r\nYou're worse than no-name over there.\r\nNo matter.\r\nAnyone crossing the Umbra will pay.”",
  "LV_009000_1000_JEA": "The elder would really give me an earful if she knew I was here – whatever, I'm used to her lectures.",
  "CE_009820_0000_SIN": "Arch-Eve Origin, show us more of your pain!",
  "BK_9010_0110_SIN": "“I'm surprised that one so young was able to resist my power.\r\nBut I shall have you before long.”",
  "LV_009000_2000_JEA": "Cereza, where are you?\r\nThat girl, always getting herself into trouble...",
  "SM_009010_0310_JEA": "“What's the fuss?\r\nAny name will do, right?\r\nOff we go now, Charles.\r\nWe've no time to waste.”",
  "BK_9070_0030_SIN": "Jeanne...\r\nyou have made your choice...\r\n...That fate is now immutable!”",
  "BK_9000_0000_JEA": "“What...What could this be?!\r\nCereza...No!”",
  "LV_009010_0000_JEA": "Elemental control? Impressive.\r\nFor a demon Cereza summoned, you're not half bad.",
  "BK_9080_0380_NAR": "Let us wish her success in her journey,\r\nand put this chapter away in a safe place.",
  "BK_9010_0090_NAR": "And as for Cheshire, he was nowhere \r\nto be seen. Could this too have been \r\nthe work of the faeries?",
  "LV_009015_0000_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]You know that little crybaby?[FONT:N ]",
  "SM_009010_0320_JEA": "That was sooner than expected.\r\nI've held up my end of the bargain. \r\nNow earn your keep!",
  "BK_9070_0000_SIN": "",
  "BK_9040_0050_NAR": " \r\nJeanne looked at Cereza's face. \r\nIt was as pale as ice.",
  "BK_9050_0220_SIN": "“Jeanne, you have seen what awaits you.\r\nYet still, you would face me...?”",
  "BK_9060_0110_JEA": "Open your eyes, you fool!”",
  "BK_9070_0010_NAR": "The spectre's blood-curdling \r\nscream seemed to\r\nshatter the air itself.",
  "SM_009020_0190_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]You think I'd trust you with that?\r\nJust keep it simple. \r\nPut me back where you found me.[FONT:N ]",
  "LV_009050_0010_JEA": "Who's there?",
  "LV_009020_0030_NAR": "Jeanne thought that Charles's\r\nfelt cheeks looked more red than usual.",
  "SM_009020_0320_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]But, you saved me back there.\r\nI suppose I can make an exception this once.[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire added softly.",
  "BK_9060_0150_NAR": "The room was flooded with \r\na light as bright as a sun.\r\nFor a moment, everything around them \r\nseemed to dissolve in the radiant glow.",
  "LV_009055_0000_SIN": "I'll take no joy in watching you die...\r\nOnce is enough.",
  "SM_009020_0310_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I don't take orders from humans.[FONT:N ]",
  "BK_9020_0100_JEA": "“Cereza, where are you...?”",
  "CE_009805_2000_SIN": "You know what awaits, yet still you struggle?",
  "BK_9020_0090_JEA": "“I'm sure of it now...\r\nSomething is afoot in this forest, \r\nand it's not just the faeries.”",
  "SM_009020_0280_NAR": "Cheshire sighed and furrowed his brow.\r\nBut somewhere deep down, he was relieved.",
  "LV_009025_0000_JEA": "Cereza...She's close by, I can feel it!\r\nBut where...?",
  "LV_009055_0020_NAR": "Jeanne's voice echoed through the still forest.",
  "BK_9060_0170_SIN": "",
  "LV_009015_0040_JEA": "Cereza and I have a duty to become stronger. \r\nWe must protect the legacy of the Umbra.",
  "CE_009815_0000_SIN": "Aren't you dying to see what comes next?",
  "SM_009020_0150_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Which? What do you mean, which?[FONT:N ]\r\nCharles returned with a puzzled look.",
  "SM_009010_0270_JEA": "“To think this would come in handy here.\r\n...Demon. Speak your name.”",
  "SM_009010_0110_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Hmph. Like I know where that brat is.[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire said, trying unsuccessfully to hide\r\nthe desperation in his voice.",
  "BK_9040_0090_NAR": "The source of Jeanne's unease \r\nappeared before them now.\r\nHe was suspended in the air like a fell spectre.",
  "CE_009805_1000_SIN": "Are you prepared to accept your fate, Jeanne?",
  "BK_9050_0000_JEA": "“What's the matter?\r\nDon't tell me you're giving up already.”",
  "BK_9040_0100_NAR": "Fixed by his gaze,\r\nneither dared to so much as breathe.",
  "SM_009010_0080_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Cereza...how do you know the girl?[FONT:N ]\r\nEyes narrowed, Cheshire studied \r\nJeanne with new interest.",
  "BK_9080_0370_NAR": "It may not be possible to change one's destiny.\r\nHowever, Jeanne's indomitable spirit and steadfast resolve\r\nwill surely guide her down a true path.",
  "LV_009040_0000_JEA": "Wait...the cracks here...\r\nI can feel Cereza from the other side!",
  "BK_9040_0120_SIN": "“So we meet again, my brave friend.\r\nOr, perhaps introductions are in order.",
  "SM_009020_0200_JEA": "“I see.\r\nHave it your way.”",
  "BK_9050_0040_JEA": "“How...how do you know my name?!”",
  "CE_009825_3000_SIN": "Do not get in my way!",
  "BK_9010_0020_NAR": "This is a story of two young witches\r\nwho were joined by a powerful bond.\r\nFrom this time forth, it must forever remain a secret,\r\nnever to be repeated.",
  "BK_9060_0000_JEA": "“Charles!”",
  "SM_009020_0110_NAR": "She was not yet awake,\r\nbut from the faint smile on her face,\r\nshe appeared to be having a pleasant dream.",
  "BK_9020_0060_NAR": "Jeanne's technique split her soul from her \r\nbody. She flew towards Avalon Forest.",
  "BK_9040_0150_SIN": "“Arch-Eve Origin.",
  "BK_9060_0030_JEA": "“Stop!”",
  "BK_9040_0160_SIN": "To think that her continued defiance \r\nwould bring me to this place.”",
  "SM_009020_0240_JEA": "“Heh, that so.”",
  "BK_9040_0210_JEA": "“Return Cereza,\r\nor prepare to feel the wrath of the Umbra!”",
  "CE_009830_0000_JEA": "Using Cereza's pain...what a cowardly trick!",
  "SM_009010_0160_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Find Cereza...?[FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon eyed Jeanne suspiciously.",
  "BK_9010_0010_NAR": "Those of you who have read that tale to its conclusion\r\nmay recall this part of the story.\r\nIt is here the secret chapter begins.",
  "BK_9050_0140_SIN": "“...Arch-Eve Origin.\r\nYou cannot resist much longer.\r\nSoon you will give me \r\nthat which I desire.”",
  "BK_9050_0230_JEA": "“I won't run away.\r\nI am going to be the strongest witch of all!”",
  "LV_009015_0030_JEA": "She may blubber from time to time,\r\nbut look past the tears and you'll \r\nfind a truly spectacular power.",
  "CE_009825_4000_SIN": "You...stay away from me!",
  "SM_009010_0040_JEA": "“Who's there?! Show yourself!”",
  "SM_009010_0280_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I don't have one![FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon showed his gratitude the only \r\nway he knew how: an angry roar.",
  "BK_9040_0060_JEA": "“Cereza!”",
  "SM_009010_0070_JEA": "“You're...a demon?\r\nWhat are you doing there?\r\nWhere's Cereza?”",
  "CE_009825_0000_SIN": "I'm being struck by an oversized toy? ",
  "SM_009010_0250_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]All right, let me into that blasted cat!\r\nBut if this is a trick, you're lunch![FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon reluctantly agreed to Jeanne's plan.",
  "CE_009800_0000_SIN": "Resistance is futile.",
  "BK_9050_0020_NAR": "But the spectre was unphased.\r\nAs he got to his feet, \r\na faint smile crossed his lips.",
  "LV_009040_0020_NAR": "What lay waiting on the other side?\r\nHad they finally found Cereza...?",
  "BK_9020_0000_JEA": "“Cereza!”",
  "BK_9050_0030_SIN": "“You still don't understand, \r\ndo you Jeanne? What will \r\nhappen if you oppose me...”",
  "LV_009030_0000_JEA": "What are these cracks...?\r\nFaerie tricks?",
  "CE_009800_4000_SIN": "Arch-Eve Origin will be mine!",
  "SM_009020_0140_JEA": "“Well Charles, which will it be?”",
  "SM_009020_0220_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Hmph, I hate them both the same.[FONT:N ]\r\nCharles grumbled in his usual \r\nirritated manner.",
  "BK_9050_0190_SIN": "“Perhaps I was too soft.\r\nWitness your cruel fate, once more.”",
  "BK_9060_0040_SIN": "“Yes...\r\nThat is what you humans say \r\nin the face of defeat.",
  "LV_009045_0010_JEA": "Charles, was that you just now?",
  "SM_009010_0100_JEA": "“What have you done with her?\r\nGet out here and explain yourself!”",
  "BK_9050_0180_NAR": "Jeanne stood tall in defiance.",
  "LV_009040_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]What?![FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon's eyes grew wide.",
  "BK_9050_0010_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]He probably tastes horrible.\r\nI better swallow him in one gulp.[FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon was already licking his chops.",
  "BK_9040_0110_JEA": "“You're the one who was speaking \r\nto me before. Who are you?”",
  "SM_009010_0090_JEA": "“I'm an Umbra Witch...\r\n...apprentice, Jeanne.\r\nI've come to save Cereza.”",
  "LV_009020_0010_JEA": "And I dare say you seem to like it.",
  "SM_009020_0300_JEA": "“And don't you dare tell Cereza \r\nwhat happened here. I mean it.”",
  "BK_9020_0110_NAR": "Jeanne had successfully arrived \r\nin Avalon. The forest air was tinged \r\nwith a vile presence.",
  "BK_9020_0080_NAR": "For she aspired to surpass Cereza and become \r\nthe strongest of all the Umbra Witches,\r\na goal that allowed no room for cowardice.",
  "BK_9070_0070_NAR": "As if in response,\r\ncracks and fissures burst all around them,\r\nand the world began to crumble.",
  "SM_009020_0290_JEA": "“Farewell, Charles...no, Cheshire.”",
  "LV_009025_0010_NAR": "Charles heard Jeanne but said nothing.",
  "CE_009810_0010_SIN": "Have a taste of the fear that \r\nresides within Arch-Eve Origin.",
  "BK_9010_0040_CER": "“Cheshire?\r\nWhere are you, Cheshire!?”",
  "BK_9040_0030_NAR": "Jeanne followed Charles's gaze.\r\nShe could see a small figure \r\nfloating in the distance.",
  "BK_9040_0190_NAR": "But Jeanne and Charles did not back down.",
  "BK_9070_0050_SIN": "",
  "SM_009010_0180_NAR": "Jeanne produced a stuffed animal \r\nof her own: a handsome red stuffed cat.",
  "BK_9010_0070_CER": "",
  "SM_009020_0330_JEA": "“If I didn't know better,\r\nI'd swear I was talking to a human.\r\nTake care of my friend, furball.”",
  "CE_009800_3000_SIN": "Meaningless.",
  "BK_9060_0140_JEA": "Keep your promise.\r\nIf you've any pride as an Umbra Witch...\r\nNow's the time to prove it!”",
  "CE_009810_0030_NAR": "Using the magic of the faerie realm,\r\nthis technique gave shape \r\nto the pain inside Cereza's heart.",
  "LV_009025_0020_NAR": "Deep down worry weighed heavy on his heart.\r\nHe let out a sigh.",
  "BK_9050_0210_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]That pipsqueak made a promise to me\r\nshe has yet to fulfil. You can't have her![FONT:N ]\r\nThe beast gave a fierce roar.",
  "LV_009015_0010_NAR": "Charles eyed Jeanne suspiciously as he spoke.",
  "SM_009010_0290_JEA": "“I see.\r\nThen I shall call you Charles.”",
  "BK_9010_0080_NAR": "Trapped within a strange void,\r\nCereza had been petrified by \r\na mysterious force.",
  "BK_9050_0170_JEA": "“...I told you. You won't lay a finger on my Umbran sister!”",
  "SM_009010_0060_NAR": "But it took all his strength just to \r\nkeep from being swallowed. \r\nHe could barely move an inch.",
  "BK_9070_0020_SIN": "“This...is unfathomable!",
  "BK_9080_0390_NAR": "Forevermore, this story will remain our little secret...",
  "BK_9060_0130_JEA": "“Cereza, did you forget our promise?\r\nWe swore to become stronger...together!",
  "BK_9010_0100_SIN": "“My thanks...\r\nThe faeries' power resonated through \r\nyour memories to guide me here.”",
  "BK_9050_0200_SIN": "“You too...?!”",
  "BK_9060_0100_JEA": "“Cereza...Cereza!",
  "SM_009020_0180_NAR": "For a moment, Charles simply \r\nstared at Jeanne, saying nothing.\r\nFinally, he spoke.",
  "BK_9060_0090_JEA": "“Cereza, wake up!”",
  "BK_9010_0030_CER": "“Am I...back in the forest?”",
  "BK_9040_0040_NAR": "It was Cereza. \r\nShe was unnaturally still,\r\nfrozen by some unknown power.",
  "SM_009010_0050_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Don't play dumb.\r\nYou trapped me in here, didn't you?[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire said as he struggled\r\nto break free.",
  "BK_9060_0020_NAR": "The spectre's right hand began to glow with an icy glimmer.",
  "SM_009020_0250_NAR": "Seeing through his act, \r\nJeanne smiled at the flustered demon.\r\nShe used her Umbran Arts \r\nto grant his wish, and returned \r\nhim to his former body.",
  "BK_9050_0060_NAR": "Jeanne and Charles found they were unable to move.\r\nThe spectre had them in his spell.",
  "LV_009000_0000_JEA": "So this is the infamous faerie forest...\r\nBut there's something else here...I'm sure of it.",
  "SM_009010_0170_JEA": "“That's the deal.\r\nIf you say you'll help me, I'll move you \r\nto a body in a less precarious position.\r\nI have just the thing.”",
  "SM_009010_0220_NAR": "Jeanne turned her back on \r\nthe prideful demon, and prepared \r\nto set off on her own.",
  "BK_9070_0080_JEA": "“It's...all falling apart.\r\nWas this all just his illusion?",
  "CE_009840_0000_JEA": "Your tricks won't work any more. Come on!"
}
